Now we substitute $\blueD{y=-2x^5}$ and $\goldD{\dfrac{dy}{dx}=-10x^4}$ into the equation:

$\begin{align}
\goldD{\dfrac{dy}{dx}}&=\dfrac{5\blueD{y}}{x}
\\\\
\goldD{-10x^4}&\stackrel{?}{=}\dfrac{5\left(\blueD{-2x^5}\right)}{x}
\\\\
-10x^4&\stackrel{?}{=}\dfrac{-10x^5}{x}
\\\\
-10x^4&\stackrel{\checkmark}{=}-10x^4
\end{align}$

We obtained the same expression on each side.
